body:

Around PyCon DE 2027 in Heidelberg, the community organizes hackathons, workshops,
meetups and more — open to everyone.

## Satellite Events & Initiatives

### Django Girls Workshop

A free, beginner-friendly programming workshop on the Masterclass day, Monday, 19 April 2027.

### Open-Source Sprints

Two days of open-source contribution right after the conference, 23–24 April 2027.
[Join the sprints](/sprints/)

### PyLadies at PyCon DE

PyLadies community activities and networking around the conference.


## Hackathons

### CHiLI — Community Hackathon in Linguistics & Informatics

📅 Friday–Saturday, 23–24 April 2027, alongside the [Sprints](/sprints/)<br>
📍 Heidelberg<br>
👥 Organized by Katja Konermann, Jakob Schuster & Team

A two-day hackathon for up to 40 students at the intersection of language and technology.
The first edition asks how politics and language technology go together.

[CHiLI details](/satellite-events/chili/)

## Propose a Satellite Event

Planning a hackathon, workshop, meetup or another community event around the conference?
We'd love to hear about it.

**Call for community events:** is open, selection is ongoing, no submissions after 21 February 2027.

## Ready to Apply?

Please fill out this form to apply [apply](https://forms.gle/k1dVWBdzJc6Vbit67). The sprints team will get back to you asap.

## Questions?

Please get in touch via the [contact form](/contact/).
